{"slug":"roma","name":"Roma","description":"Roma is an AI task app for keeping lists, tasks, notes and automations, with an operator that helps do the work.","icon":"https://storage.googleapis.com/stuff.thingsofbrand.com/roma.app/images/img2_roma.png","domain":"roma.app","rank":86,"labels":["Productivity"],"categories":[],"eventsRead":true,"events":[{"n":"Create Item","d":"Create a task, note or row on a chosen Roma list.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Get Item Details","d":"Retrieve a single item with its body and fields; optionally include images, image URLs, or files.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Find Items","d":"List and filter a list's items, or search the whole workspace by meaning or keyword.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Update Item","d":"Update an item's title, body, property values, status, due date or flags.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Delete Item","d":"Move one or more items to the Roma trash, where they stay recoverable for about 30 days.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Move Items","d":"Move one or more items to another list; choose items, destination list, and optionally allow value loss.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Create List","d":"Create a Roma list for tasks, or a list shaped by your own properties.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Post Chat Message","d":"Post a message in an item's chat and optionally set agent name, mentions, details, conversation, or reply settings.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Run Automation","d":"Start one of your Roma automations now; its result lands in your Roma chat.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"New Item","d":"Runs when an item (task, note or row) is created on your Roma lists, optionally only on chosen lists.","t":"trigger","k":"hook"},{"n":"Updated Item","d":"Runs when an item's title, due date, property or archived flag changes, optionally narrowed by field.","t":"trigger","k":"hook"},{"n":"Updated Task Status","d":"Runs when a task's status changes, optionally only when it moves to a chosen status.",